>> f1 := Ifayile entsha: ['notafile'].
>> f2 := Ifayile entsha: ['/tmp/test.txt'].
(f2 ikhona) inyaniso: { f2 cima.}.
Imveliso bhala: f2 indlela-yefayile.
f2 bhala: ['Hello!'].
f2 yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['World!'].
Imveliso bhala: f2 funda.
(f2 ikhona) inyaniso: { Imveliso bhala: ['!']. }.
(f1 ikhona) inyaniso: { Imveliso bhala: ['!']. }.
Imveliso bhala: f2 ubungakanani, bhala: f1 ubungakanani.
f2 cima. Imveliso bhala: f2 ubungakanani.

